.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK RELEASE ARCHIVE"
.SH NAME
hamstik release archive \- Archive a release version
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik release archive [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Archive a release version
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I ID
Release version id (UUID)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --reason
Why the release was archived
.TP
.B --force
Bypass revision conflict protection (If-Match: *)
Choices: true, false
.TP
.B --project
Project key (overrides context)
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Explicit idempotency key
